# National Unified Material Master Framework — SIH Project

## Stack
- Next.js 16 App Router
- React 19
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS 4
- Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL
- Lucide React + Recharts

## Conventions
- Use Server Components by default; mark interactivity with `"use client"`.
- All DB tables defined in `src/db/schema.ts` using `drizzle-orm/pg-core`.
- Import db from `@/db`.
- Use `src/lib/utils.ts` for `cn()` helper.
- API routes return `NextResponse.json({ success, data, message })`.
- Keep hackathon demo seed in `src/lib/seed.ts`.
